# Raiden Furina Nahida Escoffier. ~21s Rot. On-Field Raiden Hyperbloom. Raiden builds significant ER for optimal team DPS. Nahida fills time for Furina's skill CD after Raiden's burst. Superconduct comprises ~15% of Raiden's DPS.

# Team - Options Listed by DPS
raiden char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
raiden add weapon="fjords" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
raiden add set="gd" count=4;
raiden add stats hp=4780 atk=311 er=0.518 em=187 em=187; #main
raiden add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.551 em=158.56 cr=0.1324 cd=0.3972;

